---
fmContentType: glossaryEntry
term: "Cola"
letter: "C"
anchor: "cola"
category: "growing"
---

The main flower cluster of a cannabis plant — the large central bud that forms at the top of the main stem, and smaller clusters on lateral branches. Colas are the primary harvest site and contain the highest concentration of trichomes and cannabinoids. Well-trained plants produce multiple large colas rather than one main cola with smaller underdeveloped buds below.
